  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.32,
      387.19,
      286.68,
      408.8
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: 3/2/8/9/1. Land Ministry\u2019s Reference No.: 4/3/15/2010/VE/297.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      410.24,
      286.68,
      500.72
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (i) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, As amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for the area described below is required to give out under widening of villages :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      502.15,
      286.68,
      592.64
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: Following allotment in the extent of 02.9223 hectares, mentioned in the Preliminary Plan Mu.Pi.Nu.2900 dated 13.11.2013 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village of Maethagama in Medapane Korale in Kotmale Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Nuwaraeliya District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      594.07,
      314.21,
      661.76
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1 Name of the land: Dombahasthalawa; Division: 456 H, Dombagasthalawa; Description: required to give out under widening of villages; Claimants: Land Reform Commission; Extent: 2.9223 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      346.16,
      539.85,
      413.84
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land on which a servitude is to be acquire are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat Office of Kotmale on the 20th day of September, 2016 at 9.00 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      417.92,
      539.83,
      528.8
    ],
    "text": "Further, it is hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 13th day of September, 2016, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      532.4,
      500.52,
      671.36
    ],
    "text": "I.M. SENANAYAKA, Divisional Secretary, Kotmale. Divisional Secretariat Office, Kotmale, 12th August, 2016 09 - 129",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
